{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qJZI6xuL2u1794466999.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>教宗良十四世抵達南美訪問行程最後一站秘魯，被視為「返鄉之旅」。</p><p></p><p>良十四世周三乘專機抵達秘魯首都利馬，秘魯總統藤森慶子到場迎接。沿路歡迎他的人龍綿延數公里，梵蒂岡估計約有三百萬人。良十四世之後前往總統府，與藤森慶子會談，兩人隨後一同出席活動。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PERU.POPE-1300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026G6WNa15Oto1794467021.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>良十四世發表演說，稱此訪是回到傳教生涯的起點，有特別的意義。良十四世自2015至2023年，在秘魯北部城市奇拉克約擔任主教。他擁有美國與秘魯雙重國籍，亦是兩國首位教宗。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:43:59.589313+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T04:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T07:57:12.610862+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T07:37:16.260348+00:00","content_hash":"3c5e2446953d19cf8b0b5cf4fd52fbc09f7d0254814c106870d1eed34e6713ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:43:59.589313+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}